{"id":"P087-1","subject":"P","unit":"P087","unitTitle":"2025 ② (5월~8월) · 25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션)","set":1,"questions":[{"id":"P087-S1-Q01","number":1,"question":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 1번","searchText":" 01\n\n정격용량MVA 과 pu가 각각 120MVA, 0.2pu\n\n인 발전기, 60MVA, 0.09pu인 변압기, 100MVA ,\n\n0.3pu인 모선으로 구성된 계통이 있다. 이 계통에서\n\n161kV에 대한 단락사고시의 단락전류는 약 몇 pu인가?\n\n(단, 기준용량은 100MVA 로 계산한다.)\n\n\n① 1.2          ② 1.6\n\n③ 2.1          ④ 2.5\n\n⑤ 3.2","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e09-m01","number":1},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m01-q.webp","width":678,"height":683},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m01-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1307}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P087-S1-Q02","number":2,"question":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 2번","searchText":" 02\n\n60Hz, 22kV선로에서 6MVar의 델타결선된 콘덴서\n\n의 제5고조파(300Hz)를 제거하기 위한 리액터를 직렬로\n\n설치하려고 한다. 이 경우, 필요한 리액터의 리액턴스는 몇\n\nΩ인가?\n\n\n① 42.2         ② 48.4\n\n③ 52.6         ④ 58.2\n\n⑤ 64.4","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e09-m02","number":2},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m02-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m02-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1834}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P087-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 3번","searchText":" 03\n\n500MW 수력발전계통에서 임계전력각이 58°이고, 실제\n\n전력각이 29°라면, 여유각의 비율은 몇 인가?\n\n\n① 25          ② 40\n\n③ 50          ④ 60\n\n⑤ 75","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e09-m03","number":3},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m03-q.webp","width":678,"height":510},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m03-e1.webp","width":678,"height":659}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P087-S1-Q04","number":4,"question":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 4번","searchText":" 04\n\n3상 평형부하의 선간전압이 380V, 선전류가 15A 이고,\n\n지상역률 0.9일 때, 부하의 유효전력은 몇 kW인가?\n\n①        ② \n③        ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e09-m04","number":4},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m04-q.webp","width":696,"height":652},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m04-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1223}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P087-S1-Q05","number":5,"question":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 5번","searchText":" 05\n\nMVA, 인 동기발전기 2대를 병렬운전할\n때, 이 계통의 단락용량은 몇 MVA 인가?\n\n\n① 417         ② 600\n\n③ 833         ④ 1000\n\n⑤ 1200","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e09-m05","number":5},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m05-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m05-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1158}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P087-S1-Q06","number":6,"question":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 6번","searchText":" 06\n\n수차의 특유속도가 250m･kW이상일 때 운전해야하는\n\n수력 발전기는?\n\n\n① 소용량 저낙차     ② 소용량 고낙차\n\n③ 대용량 저낙차     ④ 대용량 고낙차\n\n⑤ 소용량 중낙차","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e09-m06","number":6},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m06-q.webp","width":696,"height":541},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m06-e1.webp","width":696,"height":724}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P087-S1-Q07","number":7,"question":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 7번","searchText":" 07\n\n6극, 55Hz, 3상 전동기의 동기속도는 몇 rpm인가?\n\n\n① 900         ② 1000\n\n③ 1100         ④ 1200\n\n⑤ 1250","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e09-m07","number":7},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m07-q.webp","width":678,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m07-e1.webp","width":678,"height":379}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P087-S1-Q08","number":8,"question":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 8번","searchText":" 08\n\n230V의 전원에 동일한 2개의 저항을 직렬로 접속할 때,\n\n회로에 흐르는 전류를 5A 이하로 하기 위한 각 저항의\n\n최솟값은 몇 Ω인가?\n\n\n① 12          ② 18\n\n③ 23          ④ 46\n\n⑤ 58","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e09-m08","number":8},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m08-q.webp","width":678,"height":723},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m08-e1.webp","width":678,"height":693}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P087-S1-Q09","number":9,"question":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 9번","searchText":" 09\n\n저항접지방식에서, 중성점 저항 값을 값을 25옴에서 10옴\n\n으로 변경했을때 저감율은 몇 인가?\n\n\n① 20          ② 40\n\n③ 30          ④ 10\n\n⑤ 5","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e09-m09","number":9},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m09-q.webp","width":678,"height":557},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m09-e1.webp","width":678,"height":479}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P087-S1-Q10","number":10,"question":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 10번","searchText":" 10\n\n고저항 접지방식에서 주로 사용되는 계전기는 무엇인가?\n\n\n① 지락 과전압 계전기  ② 지락 과전류 계전기\n\n③ 지락 저항 계전기   ④ 지락 거리 계전기\n\n⑤ 지락 방향 계전기","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e09-m10","number":10},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m10-q.webp","width":696,"height":443},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m10-e1.webp","width":678,"height":333}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P087-S1-Q11","number":11,"question":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 11번","searchText":" 11\n\n직류 발전기의 전기자 권선법 중 직렬권과 병렬권에 대한\n\n내용으로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n① 직렬권은 병렬회로수가 극수에 비례한다.\n\n② 직렬권은 저전압 소전류용이다.\n\n③ 병렬권은 고전압 대전류용이다.\n\n④ 병렬권은 균압환이 필요하지 않다.\n\n⑤ 직렬권은 균압환이 필요하지 않다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e09-m11","number":11},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m11-q.webp","width":696,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m11-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P087-S1-Q12","number":12,"question":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 12번","searchText":" 12\n\n3상 동기 발전기에서 그림과 같은 전기자 반작용의 영향으\n\n로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 주자속 감소로 인해 유기기전력이 감소한다.\n\n② 전류의 위상이 유기기전력보다 90° 앞선다.\n\n③ 주자속 증가로 인해 유기기전력이 증가한다.\n\n④ 전류의 위상이 유기기전력보다 90° 앞선다.\n\n⑤ 교차자화작용이 나타난다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e09-m12","number":12},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m12-q.webp","width":696,"height":877},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m12-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1184}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P087-S1-Q13","number":13,"question":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 13번","searchText":" 13\n\n3상 동기전동기의 주파수가 60Hz, 극수 6, 회전자의 지\n\n름이 2m일 때, 회전자 주변속도는 몇 ms인가?\n\n(단, 으로 계산한다.)\n\n\n① 40          ② 60\n\n③ 80          ④ 100\n\n⑤ 120","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e09-m13","number":13},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m13-q.webp","width":678,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m13-e1.webp","width":678,"height":698}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P087-S1-Q14","number":14,"question":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 14번","searchText":" 14\n\n다음에 주어진 조건에 대한 3상 동기발전기의 1극당 자속\n\n은 약 몇 인가?\n\n(단, 선간전압은 5328V이고, 으로 계산한다.)\n\n ⦁극수  : 2        ⦁회전수  : 3600rpm\n\n ⦁전 슬롯수  : 150    ⦁각 슬롯당 도체수  : 2\n\n ⦁전기자 권선  : Y결선  ⦁권선 계수  : 1.0\n\n\n\n① 0.01         ② 0.02\n\n③ 0.1          ④ 0.2\n\n⑤ 0.5","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e09-m14","number":14},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m14-q.webp","width":678,"height":771},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m14-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P087-S1-Q15","number":15,"question":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 15번","searchText":" 15\n\n변압기의 내부고장 보호용으로, 변압기 양측에 CT를 결선\n\n하여 1차측과 2차측의 차전류가 동작코일에서 일정비율\n\n이상일 때 동작하며, 억제코일에서는 외부고장시에 오동작\n\n하지 않도록 억제력을 제공하는 계전기는?\n\n\n① 과전류계전기     ② 과전압계전기\n\n③ 비율차동계전기    ④ 열상계전기\n\n⑤ 거리계전기","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e09-m15","number":15},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m15-q.webp","width":678,"height":549},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m15-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1359}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P087-S1-Q16","number":16,"question":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 16번","searchText":" 16\n\n3상 권선형 유도전동기에서 비례추이 원리를 이용하여\n\n제어가능한 것은 무엇인가?\n\n\n① 1차 전류       ② 효율\n\n③ 동기속도       ④ 2차 동손\n\n⑤ 출력","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e09-m16","number":16},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m16-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m16-e1.webp","width":678,"height":523}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P087-S1-Q17","number":17,"question":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 17번","searchText":" 17\n\n60Hz, 12극, 3상 유도전동기의 전부하 슬립이 0.05일\n\n때, 정격 회전속도rpm는?\n\n\n① 370         ② 470\n\n③ 500         ④ 570\n\n⑤ 600","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e09-m17","number":17},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m17-q.webp","width":696,"height":683},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m17-e1.webp","width":696,"height":623}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P087-S1-Q18","number":18,"question":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 18번","searchText":" 18\n\n동기속도가 1200rpm이고, 정격 회전속도가 1140rpm\n\n인 유도전동기의 기동토크를 전부하토크와 같도록 하기위해\n\n외부에서 2차에 삽입해야 할 저항은 2차 저항의 몇 배인가?\n\n\n① 11          ② 13\n\n③ 15          ④ 17\n\n⑤ 19","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e09-m18","number":18},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m18-q.webp","width":696,"height":557},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m18-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1259}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P087-S1-Q19","number":19,"question":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 19번","searchText":" 19\n\nkVA 의 단상변압기 차측으로 환산한 전압이 1kV,\n임피던스가 Ω일 때, %리액턴스 강하는 몇 인\n\n가?\n\n\n① 0.5          ② 1.0\n\n③ 1.5          ④ 2.0\n\n⑤ 2.5","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e09-m19","number":19},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m19-q.webp","width":678,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m19-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1360}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P087-S1-Q20","number":20,"question":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 20번","searchText":" 20\n\n다음의 사이리스터에 관한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 래칭전류가 흐를 때 게이트 전류 인가시 도통된다.\n\n② 도통되면 게이트 전류가 끊겨도 도통상태가 유지된다.\n\n③ 도통된 상태에서 역전압을 가하면 전류 흐름이 멈춘다.\n\n④ 직류 및 교류 제어용이며 단방향 제어 소자이다.\n\n⑤ 항상 역률각 이하에서만 제어가능하다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e09-m20","number":20},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m20-q.webp","width":678,"height":668},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m20-e1.webp","width":678,"height":522},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m20-e2.webp","width":696,"height":821}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P087-S1-Q21","number":21,"question":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 21번","searchText":" 21\n\n\n다음과 같은 회로에서 에 전압을 인가할 때, 에 인가\n\n되는 전압이 의 60가 될 때의 시간은 약 몇 ms인\n가? (단, ln, ln이다.)\n\n\n\n\n\n① 0.1          ② 1\n\n③ 10          ④ 50\n\n⑤ 100","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e09-m21","number":21},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m21-q.webp","width":678,"height":692},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m21-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1063},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m21-e2.webp","width":678,"height":1883}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P087-S1-Q22","number":22,"question":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 22번","searchText":" 22\n\n다음과 같은 회로에서 전류 는 약 몇 A 인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 1.125        ② 1.092\n\n③ 1.062        ④ 0.092\n\n⑤ 0.062","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e09-m22","number":22},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m22-q.webp","width":696,"height":717},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m22-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P087-S1-Q23","number":23,"question":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 23번","searchText":" 23\n\n\n직렬공진회로의 특징으로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n① 임피던스가 최소이다.\n\n② 리액턴스가 최대이다.\n\n③ 전류가 최소이다.\n\n④ 전력이 0이다.\n\n⑤ 전압과 전류의 위상이 90도 차이난다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e09-m23","number":23},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m23-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m23-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1135}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P087-S1-Q24","number":24,"question":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 24번","searchText":" 24\n\n어떤 회로의 전압이 V, 전류가 A , 전압\n\n과 전류의 위상차가 60°일 때, 회로의 유효전력W은?\n\n\n① 60          ② 120\n\n③ 180         ④ 240\n\n⑤ 340","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e09-m24","number":24},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m24-q.webp","width":696,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m24-e1.webp","width":678,"height":747}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P087-S1-Q25","number":25,"question":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 25번","searchText":" 25\n\n                        \n전달함수가            인 제어시스템에 단위  \n계단입력을 가할 때, 출력 는?\n\n\n①  ② \n③  ④ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.31 한국석유공사 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e09-m25","number":25},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m25-q.webp","width":678,"height":682},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e09-m25-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]}]}
